<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-WERDER EYE STRASBOURG'S ZITELLI.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WERDER EYE STRASBOURG'S ZITELLI.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Werder Bremen of Germany have offered around 18 million francs ($3.2 million) for Strasbourg striker David Zitelli, sources close to the Alsatian club said.</p>
<p>Zitelli, who scored 19 goals last season and both goals in Strasbourg's first win of the French league season last week, was close to a transfer to UEFA Cup holders Schalke 04 in the off-season.</p>
